  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuvalu Australia Awards Post Costs Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australian Development Scholarships (ADS) Tuvalu program is a component of the Australian Government&apos;s development cooperation program in Tuvalu and is designed to contribute to national development and reform through human resources development. ADS Scholarships are awarded annually for applicants to undertake undergraduate and postgraduate study at an Australian University. The program plays an important role in educating individuals and fostering individual and institutional relationships between Australia and Tuvalu. The total value of this initiative is $2.4 million over 6 years, starting 2010-11.</narrative>
  </description>
